    "howto": {
      "fill": "gray",
      "size": 24,
      "text": "How to try it\n\n• Press Play on Main or Cover. The ship flies itself. Move the pointer to tilt the phone: stars shift, debris falls. Click to shoot. Press Shake under the phone for a shockwave (8 s cooldown).\n• Compare the rocks with the rockStyle Tweak on Main or Cover: lattice (cells light up on the fixed 4 px grid) or outline (the earlier free stipple).\n• Main also demos Phase 2 in Tweaks: weather, night or day (real moon phase), charging. Play the music widget for the beat pulse.\n• To the right: the radar widget, and the dock icons up close. Bottom row: the home widgets at real size.\n• Weather, music, scores, trains and radar are sample data, not live.",
      "w": 340,
      "x": 1270,
      "y": 0
    },
